<title>USA: Capstar Broadcasting says files with SEC for IPO.</title>
<headline>Capstar Broadcasting says files with SEC for IPO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Capstar Broadcasting Partners Inc and its wholly owned subsidiary Commodore Media Inc said Wednesday they had filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission a registration statement related to a proposed initial public offering.</p>
<p>The company said the IPO is for $100 million of its Class A common stock.</p>
<p>The company said all shares will be offered by Capstar.</p>
<p>The company said the net proceeds from the sale will be used to repay a portion of the bank indebtness of Commodore.</p>
</text>
